window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Love. Hate. Secrets. Lies.</b></p> <p><b>All she had to do was stay away... but now, it's too late.</b></p> <p><b>Gigi</b></p> <p>My life was progressing nicely until my brother died. Since his death, I've ached to feel human again, and the feeling I gravitate towards most is danger.</p> <p>I'd never experienced that feeling… until Harry St. James stumbled into my ex-boyfriend's house at three a.m., covered in blood.</p> <p>It just so happens that his secrets hold the terror and release that I crave. And I'll stop at nothing to experience it.</p> <p><b>Harry</b></p> <p>Violence and crime are in my nature. I've devoted my life to a dark, twisted world in exchange for money and power. I'm one of the most notorious criminals in London, yet it's all worthless without her.</p> <p>If I let Gigi Thomas get too close, it's only a matter of time before I bleed the purity in her dry.</p> <p>She doesn't know everything about me. I've been keeping things from her. Dark secrets.</p> <p>I know more about her family than I've let on.</p> <p>And if she finds out, she'll kill me.</p> <p>Secrets <i>is a dark romance for mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
